10:15 AM. The ritual.

Wig on. Three and a half minutes   the fingers know the route now. Tuck, position, align, secure. The brownish-auburn waves fall into place and the phone camera shows someone else. VoxMorph calibrated   breathiness at 32% for the morning energy, pitch dialed back one notch from yesterday because the early-hour voice needs warmth, not helium. OBS loaded. Webcam tilted up   eyes, lashes, brows, hair. The feminized zone. The desk lamp angled from the left, warm gold on the cheekbones.

The OBS preview. Ellie's eyes. The last stream with this nose   the old nose, the wide one, hidden beneath the crop line. By tonight, the preview will show something new.

ElliePlayz   Live
Category: Just Chatting → Gunmetal Requiem
Viewers: 0

I look at the lens. Click "Go Live."

[[Go Live|day_5_4_other]]

