Gunmetal Requiem. Ranked. The loading screen   fill it with the hair touch, the sweep, the tuck. Three comments. The hair touch is a meme now. An ElliePlayz signature.

The match starts. I play   steady, consistent, the focus that comes from compartmentalization. Kira's homework boxed. The stranger boxed. The confession boxed. The nose boxed. Everything that hurts or complicates or requires emotional processing locked away in containers, leaving the gameplay processor with full access.

8 and 5. Positive K/D. Chat celebrates.

