I load Gunmetal Requiem. Ranked. The gameplay tonight carries residual energy from the Rift Walkers session with Marcus   the coordination sharpened, the reflexes primed, the muscle memory of two hours of dungeon-running translating into cleaner aim and faster reactions.

First match: 10 and 5. Double digits. The second time I've hit ten kills and the chat reacts like a championship.

<<chat "stream_viewer_f6" "TEN AND FIVE. NOSE BUFF CONFIRMED.">>

