Second match. 8 and 6. Positive again. The consistency is becoming a pattern   five consecutive positive-K/D streams, the growth curve that chat narrates as "ascending" and that I know is just the stabilization of a nervous system that's been running on better food and less cortisol and the quiet warmth of people who pay attention to me.

<<chat "ElliePlayz" "Eight and six! Not as spicy as the ten-five but I'll take it. Consistency is queen, right?">>

