The hour passes. Donations accumulate. New viewers click in   the thumbnail has changed, the nose in the preview altering the browse-page calculus, the face-shaped thing on the screen now close enough to a face that the scroll-stop instinct fires faster. The click-through rate is visibly improved. New names appear in chat at a faster rate than any previous stream, then   forty-seven minutes in   a new name.

