A new peak. The nose did what the nose was supposed to do   drop the crop line, expand the face, increase the engagement. The algorithm rewarding the new input. The system responding to the additional data point   more face, more features, more Ellie   with more viewers, more clicks, more money.

I end it. The wink   the eye closing, the lash against the cheek, and now the nose visible in the wink's profile, the full upper-face composition moving as one gesture.

<<chat "ElliePlayz" "358 viewers on nose reveal night! I'm literally going to implode. Thank you, thank you, thank you. Same eyes, same nose, tomorrow and soon... more. The cathedral is under construction. I love you all. Goodnight!">>

