$264 tonight. $211 this morning. Day 5 total (ElliePlayz): $475.

Grand total ElliePlayz earnings: $1,048.

Over a thousand dollars. In five days. From a voice modulator and a wig and a face being rebuilt one feature at a time in a clinic four blocks from a studio apartment with a crack in the ceiling. A thousand dollars that EliPlays   with its 54 followers and its DarkSlayer and its eight months of $3.50 sessions   wouldn't earn in a year.

I close OBS. Close VoxMorph. Take off the wig. Eli returns. The lashes and brows and nose   orphaned, stranded on a masculine frame, the jewelry without the outfit.

I open the RegenaForm app. Browse. The Tier 1 menu.

Nose   Slope: $500 (on credit, due in 6 days) ✓
Next: Lips   Natural-Full: $400
Then: Jawline   Soft: $600
Then: Cheekbones   Soft & Full: $400
Then: Skin treatment   Blemish Purge + Glow: $500

Total remaining Tier 1: ~$1,900. At current rate ($475/day): approximately four days.

Four days. Four days of streaming and the face is done. The crop line drops to zero. The face reveal happens. The cathedral is complete.

Sophie's comment returns: "you could drop the crop line another half inch." She's right. The next modification   lips   would let the line drop again. Each feature purchased is an inch of visibility. Each inch is an increment of trust from an audience that's building Ellie in their imaginations while I'm building her in a clinic.

I close the app.

I check my phone. One new message.

<<kira "sweet dreams eli. i meant what i said. i'll be here when you're ready for the rest. no rush. ❤️">>

The red heart. The promise. The patience that has no deadline but isn't infinite. She'll be here. She said she'll be here and the "rest" she's waiting for   the parts I can't explain yet, the other half of the actual feelings   grows larger every day that I don't explain it. Every modification. Every stream. Every dollar. The "rest" accumulates interest the way the RegenaForm credit does, compounding in the dark.

<<eli "sweet dreams kira. thank you for being here. ❤️">>

Sent. Genuine. Incomplete.

